#30000
Blood Bowl~
Blood Bowl is a quest game that is a take off from the sport
Football.  Myself and my old roomate Picric have put it together
and we hope it turns out well.
Diamond
~
300 512 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#30001
Blood Bowl~
     The walls are painted with the blood of heros long forgotten.
Bones, belonging to every race you can imagine, litter the ground
giving the field an eerie, ghost-like presence.  Victory, Death
and Pain await you...  FIGHT!
~
